	(text "OOMWOO front ToF board\n- One design, fitted twice: left and right, each aimed ~30 deg off centre.\n- Refs in the 2000s: each board has its own range.\n- Use a same-direction (pin 1 - pin 1) SH 7-pin cable\n- No mounting holes: the board slides into a holder by its long edges.\n  Keep about 1 mm along both long edges free of parts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 40.132 0)
